{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "62541e10144057255268f3c09050345ef6e4cef7eda163358ba6b36252451e49", "ja": "あの日のわたし", "zh": "那一天的我", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c8da9e0835d7f39dd9500825554dc207930cbc3135f4279229f08d92e49a782d", "ja": "あれこれと要望を出したものの気にいらず、\n遂に泣き出してしまうひまり。そんな彼女を\n見て、昔の自分のようだと話す桃子。桃子の\n昔の話を聞いた瑞希は、自分達でひまりの話\nを聞かせてもらうのはどうかと提案する。", "zh": "虽然提出了各种各样的要求，却都不合心意，\n向日葵终于哭了出来。看着这样的她，\n桃子说她就像过去的自己一样。听了桃子\n过去的事之后，瑞希提议不如由她们自己\n来听向日葵倾诉一番。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "74db7fcca9546d41de8bc57253182aa7c03fab837ccb2585f451d35f248e50cf", "ja": "（CM撮影現場の空気は良好、このまま本番に突入！\n……のはずだったんだけど……）", "zh": "（广告拍摄现场的气氛很好，本来应该就这样进入正式拍摄了！……但事情本该是这样的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "d22fd0b6a5e0a1e20925c9988ee4432174bceb1de64a0eb3d27984c34304ed51", "ja": "{$P$}、\n私が担当する商品の資料をもらってきました。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n我拿到了我负责的商品资料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "c20cabbd473d835b31ca393c6e3efc4d97d0317747201cac262e29aec00f32f7", "ja": "新商品のヘアオイルだそうです。テスターも、\nあとで使ってみようかと。……あ、いい匂い。", "zh": "听说是新发售的护发油。我也想之后试试试用装。……啊，好香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "59c524019234ec63e61cace81771d3b7bca4965505e7fbe3b51d7de3bf7a60ad", "ja": "お、ありがとう！\n目を通させてもらうよ。", "zh": "哦，谢谢你！\n我先看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "f470bdf13d8e0bdc32861a2d0dc45a786af4102460d76c25fb18d784d562b5b2", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。\n……あの、周防さんは……？", "zh": "请多关照。\n……那个，周防小姐呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "55a99ccb45b9a7a95b76db740fbf5d9388c3262e6b96d456f1358f6300c77187", "ja": "うーん、それが……。", "zh": "嗯，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1006_himari", "source_sha256": "2e717e440728d152e0d1bd37c652049d00df39ff3a6dfbc6cdff1a80bf7f5076", "ja": "……なんだか、気にいらないです。\nわたしのおもってたのと、ちがいます……。", "zh": "……总觉得，有些不能接受。\n跟我原本想的，完全不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "c234308623a2990bb8afe17a76f1a8b9fa29a41dbc23ac9a3c3a4ec5652a2e21", "ja": "くしもヘアゴムも変えたし、ライティングも\n調整したでしょ？　あとはどうしたいの？", "zh": "梳子和发圈也换了，灯光也调整过了吧？接下来还想怎么改？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1008_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "5fa47b21c971b89e93e90c7f01ab9451ae379f03fa368dc021187181d151b29e", "ja": "そうですね……ひまりさんがどうしたいか、\n具体的に教えてもらえるといいんだけど。", "zh": "是啊……要是能具体告诉我，ひまり小姐想怎么做就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1009_himari", "source_sha256": "1d415d47fbabfd11e2a5942b794c124ca57b8ef2970f4a3fb904ac8cab10142a", "ja": "なんか、ちがうんだもん……。\nよくわからないけど、もっと……。", "zh": "总觉得不太一样嘛……  \n虽然不太明白，但还想要更多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "f1fa9b32f8d9a115267a423eb7e7b3ab89ac928c723677e266ee3fa37adbcf49", "ja": "それじゃあ、次のシーンから撮る？\n手鏡もかわいいのがあるから……。", "zh": "那就从下一个场景开始拍？  \n因为还有可爱的手镜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1011_himari", "source_sha256": "97453ae4face8e275d274259e4c24d7c2a71cda6d2e29534f93372aee8b75eb4", "ja": "い、いいの！　仕ごとはちゃんと、じゅんばんに\nできるもん……！　かがみがなくても……あっ！", "zh": "没、没关系的！工作我会好好地按顺序\n做完的……！就算没有镜子也……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1012_se", "source_sha256": "f352f0f076558451454522141fd193b0ad93b02508a028e4f6d482a38f70566c", "ja": "ガシャン！", "zh": "哐当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1013_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "b68ae17a1777b2e377aaae2f271c3ca99f5a84f840b28964d1483cbe1ab4b05c", "ja": "大変！　手鏡が割れて……\nみんな、その場から動かないでくださいね！", "zh": "糟糕！手镜摔碎了……\n大家请先待在原地别动哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "781c7188afdfb6fa151243f13d2602be952df99f796f1159b62687e2c4ab501b", "ja": "！　大丈夫か桃子！", "zh": "！桃子，没事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "bc07c02c32bffa4980d8e7ccba9ff04518d2e081f412bb8df11c8749a43f0c57", "ja": "う、うん。\n桃子は、ケガとかは全然……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n桃子完全没有受伤……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1016_himari", "source_sha256": "9e676416275865f1ff25e454af5ce2c70d0e0cf062fff928ca17560d6a821bb9", "ja": "う、うう……。\nわああああん……！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……。\n哇啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1017_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "6874005def2cc222fa30dc2e49af6bc4e93d97754c5715d3d9fcec559705251e", "ja": "ひまりさん、泣かなくていいんですよ。\n撮影はいったん中断、まずは片付けましょう。", "zh": "日葵，不用哭。\n拍摄先暂停一下，先收拾吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "643670112d99454896cd58e2c43c8602e7fcbd39dae537ac82cbf74707083fb5", "ja": "子役の子……ひまりちゃんも、ケガはないみたい。\nでも、まだ泣き止んでないみたいで……。", "zh": "那个童星……小日葵好像也没有受伤。\n不过，看起来她好像还没止住哭泣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "55ec44d368e8a05c6800df97dc21dc52e6100754b0e053a98896cae443e320c7", "ja": "その、この後の撮影は\nちょっと難しいかもって……。", "zh": "那个，之后的拍摄可能有点困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "42e7d5e27de68d896f76d62adbe3b3764ceaf6c22b8f61b54c3f926a00265829", "ja": "気にすることはないよ。撮影日は今日だけ\nじゃなくて、もう1日確保してあるから。", "zh": "不用在意。拍摄日不只有今天，已经另外确保了1天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "5c2e51482140127c6064fe13e6199fec2b2cf0c98cfdffc4d5f3f7f2152729a7", "ja": "あ、そうだったんだ……。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4f24704584564712b9da8fe4b36da30a867e1f82be08eae48655960844f331c6", "ja": "子役がいる時は、想定外なことも多いから。\nおそらく今日は解散、後日撮影になるだろうな。", "zh": "有小演员在的时候，意料之外的状况也比较多。\n今天大概会先解散，改天再拍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "0b7d4d0f29fbb67b761b9211f1eba4ca1e230bcc325366fa8fcf66b3ed7dcc9f", "ja": "それにしても……\nひまりさん、大きな声で泣いていましたね。", "zh": "不过话说回来……\n向日葵小姐刚才哭得很大声呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b7f824fa44ebd524496230d8d368471891767f3f7b06f4c203ced00578e42c61", "ja": "うん。挨拶もリハも、ハキハキしていて、\nすごくしっかりした子だと思っていたけど……。", "zh": "嗯。无论是打招呼还是彩排，她都干脆利落的，我本来还以为是个特别稳重的孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "eb083fb7d1061e1cc6af21a9725c77bb3d57434a7afc3c2886e87796d1812502", "ja": "……。なんか、あの子……\n昔の桃子を見てるみたいだったな……。", "zh": "……总觉得，那孩子……\n看起来就像以前的桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "64b41caf516496e54fef6bd968faed8c71ff9bbdea54e4350c27a8bd8b5dc0ff", "ja": "ああいう風に、不機嫌になって、\n周りに当たったりして、困らせて……。", "zh": "像那样闹别扭，\n还冲周围的人发脾气，让大家为难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "44bd355d364defac312c75ae0c08ed9e57f596e32c20779a2c7f0ce22cfd2e84", "ja": "そうか。……桃子は、当時どうして\nそうなっちゃったか、覚えていたりするか？", "zh": "这样啊……桃子还记得自己当时为什么会变成那样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "ed6da1e4675eeb780b2bf41973f9cccc43b195da16c331fe7e557ea2826ab19d", "ja": "うーん……。\nたぶん、特別なことがあったわけじゃないよ。", "zh": "嗯……  \n大概，也没发生什么特别的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "3be0875ee518d61769b038bc96c9265164c0c3698be82b10a32c841938a95ba4", "ja": "最初は……大人が、みんなが、桃子の言うこと\n聞いてくれて、うれしかったんだと思う。", "zh": "一开始……大人们，大家，都听桃子说的话，\n我想那时候是很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "f6edbaa819f2962062ffcfc31bc6fec607c1e920ea0d386628bc5dba826a2ac1", "ja": "でも、疲れてたり……その、悲しいこともあって……\n全部が、思いどおりになるわけじゃないから……。", "zh": "可是，累了的时候……那个，也会遇到难过的事……毕竟，不可能所有事情都如自己所愿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3235a8fe78de61fe55f9801c993f385ccbf7d1b688b9cc7f4412b26978d112ff", "ja": "そうだな。……周りの大人が桃子の言うことを\n聞いてくれたのは、仕事のためだしな。", "zh": "是啊……周围的大人之所以会听桃子的话，也是因为工作的缘故。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "ee609d46ef3ce41304e5a0df3f27bbb0bb63ad224b01d61bf2ecc80e61e6c36b", "ja": "うん。……桃子、今よりずっと小さかったから。\nそれがわからなかったんだよね。", "zh": "嗯……因为那时候桃子比现在小得多，所以没能明白这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "a20d54f546d558f462d4ad0b748a0d9ec331f051d46f51e0d1d53a787cd9130d", "ja": "大したことじゃないのに「どうして！」って\n爆発して。自分でも止められなくて……。", "zh": "明明不是什么大不了的事，却忍不住爆发说\n“为什么啊！”。连自己都控制不住……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "658607ee31c4d9c54f0256fb91d04b93b5e47e9e673208beb51ebefa697f696e", "ja": "最後の方は……なんで怒ってるのか、\n自分でもよくわかってなかった気がする……。", "zh": "到最后……感觉连自己都不太清楚，\n为什么会那么生气……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "6da97d889cfa59a879ba2898f656c6ab1ac1a21abcad231c9f37e01f08839e02", "ja": "そうでしたか。\n……周防さんは、とても大人なんですね。", "zh": "原来如此。\n……周防小姐真的很成熟呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "9561be2112c5f2cc4d9dbe4d7bab10e761a2ae75474dbba48e77590bbf174bbe", "ja": "え……そうかな？\nだって桃子、すごく子どもっぽいことしちゃったし。", "zh": "诶……是这样吗？\n因为桃子做了非常孩子气的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "3bb5776e9d46b8e9c3587c54c5bc622022c143ababb2c0042d7a62d2f32a4aa4", "ja": "みんな、最初は子どもですから。\n私だって、{$P$}だってそうです。", "zh": "大家一开始都是孩子。\n我也是，{$P$}也是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "98b016b3eeab62dc4c852e82c984216a5bd74d52cd2f2e2ee0c6e9c692f17024", "ja": "でも、それを振り返ることができて、\nちゃんと言葉にできるのは、大人だと思います。", "zh": "但是，能够回首往事，并且好好地用语言表达出来，我觉得这才是大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "72d953fb4f85729d6f3367a7439136f27ffcac5f5b561c285311b2c89265c11b", "ja": "瑞希の言うとおりだな。それに、\n桃子の仕事に対する姿勢は、いつでも本物だ。", "zh": "正如瑞希所说。而且，桃子对待工作的态度，一直都是真诚的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "760243134f0e8be44116fea4bc69822b72923ec219399efa6ef5d3ae9f7f7e9d", "ja": "はい、周防さんは頭もよいですし、\nとても勇気があります。演技も上手で……。", "zh": "是的，周防小姐既聪明，又非常勇敢。演技也很出色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "3fd2bce1f815343b9f925777ce26e7be597980e042354cb56d54ccc9ab11687c", "ja": "も、もういいから！\nふたりとも、桃子のことからかってるでしょ……！", "zh": "够、够了啦！\n你们两个，明明就是在拿桃子开玩笑吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "7a8dd91c28029f32750fa16173e3c7546ac7ab6c57af59c0cd0db2fcbd8ba513", "ja": "いや、決してそんなつもりは……。\nでも、大事な話をしてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "不，我绝没有那个意思……\n不过，谢谢你把这么重要的事情告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1043_044miz", "source_sha256": "d79b9fb6147bc654f15c27ccb11d5aa4e8487654a8482aa55ad682c54a2f74c8", "ja": "はい。\n話してくれてありがとうございます、周防さん。", "zh": "好的。谢谢你告诉我，周防小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "823ad6cdd292b51b7e5015cae7515d6c972bfe398befac3643c26b80bba1d8d0", "ja": "べつに……。桃子も、人に話したら、\nちょっとすっきりしたから。", "zh": "没什么……桃子跟别人说过之后，也觉得轻松了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1045_044miz", "source_sha256": "a8a45a6c13c45a8533e9a42a5884da5dc0728f9c2c2641d5e353c184c746c47a", "ja": "人に話したら、すっきりする。なるほど。\n……あの、もしよかったらですが。", "zh": "跟别人说出来，就会轻松一些。原来如此。\n……那个，如果你愿意的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1046_044miz", "source_sha256": "e6dade2922926a3b0cbb809c85272604d4f6900f3ef0795535c993d529395a03", "ja": "ひまりさんのお話も、同じように\n聞かせてもらう、というのはどうでしょう。", "zh": "要不要也请您把日葵小姐的事情，以同样的方式讲给我听呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "3f6556576d4e78c86230cef97731f7cc020f775eea59b4853e99e388c8cc7ed2", "ja": "なるほど。確かに子役も他にいないし、\n年齢が近いのは桃子、次に瑞希だからな……。", "zh": "原来如此。确实也没有其他童星了，年龄相近的就是桃子，其次是瑞希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1048_044miz", "source_sha256": "0a330439ae8658acd2bf2945111410e4e84c1d6efbefca364e908e4a106d018b", "ja": "それに、このままさよならで後日撮影というのは、\n少し寂しい気がしていたので……。", "zh": "而且，就这样道别，过几天再拍摄，总觉得有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "badc894774fee1762ef39b4e87e494107a148aba734d4b6056b6fe0950636752", "ja": "うん……いいかもしれない。話すだけで\n落ち着くことって、あると思うから。", "zh": "嗯……或许也不错。因为我觉得，光是聊聊天\n就能让人平静下来的情况，也是有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_03_1050_p", "source_sha256": "479a69f0e415fbf59af3cb5dd60779d1a8caeea40d3ebd267cf4732d34a3b17d", "ja": "そうだな……。よし、ひまりさんの\nマネージャーさんに、掛け合ってみよう。", "zh": "是啊……也对。好，那就去和向日葵小姐的经纪人谈谈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
